<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}} - I just called your office but it looks like I missed you.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">EverQuote is running a special, limited time offer (only available to select agents) where you can </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">receive our Lead Connection Service (LCS) for free through May 31, 2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">With LCS our professional lead outreach team calls your leads and passes qualified shoppers on to you. It is a proven way to increase conversion, boost efficiency, and make the most out of your leads!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Give me a call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or let’s schedule some time to connect: {{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

